        "body": "The linked example is a separate graph. Inspect its relevant nodes and relationships; this specification does not embed or execute the example.\n\nThe demos in the personal library (`plans/handles-demo`) put a ring and a diamond on the Ports of three graphs, and a graph to drag between them.",
